<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1671528894"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:49.147"><div begin="14.549" end="45.219" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.549" end="21.863" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.549" end="15.509">你</span><span begin="15.509" end="16.306">的眼</span><span begin="16.306" end="18.403">睛</span> <span begin="18.750" end="19.260">蓝</span><span begin="19.260" end="20.109">色的</span><span begin="20.109" end="20.567">一</span><span begin="20.567" end="21.242">面</span><span begin="21.242" end="21.863">海</span></p><p begin="21.946" end="29.858" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.946" end="22.621">总</span><span begin="22.621" end="23.069">是</span><span begin="23.069" end="23.786">太安</span><span begin="23.786" end="25.914">静</span> <span begin="26.280" end="26.868">像是</span><span begin="26.868" end="27.385">会</span><span begin="27.385" end="28.024">有暴</span><span begin="28.024" end="28.887">风</span><span begin="28.887" end="29.858">雨</span></p><p begin="30.262" end="36.645" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.262" end="30.763">呼唤</span><span begin="30.763" end="31.474">一个夏</span><span begin="31.474" end="32.003">季</span> <span begin="32.003" end="32.396">也</span><span begin="32.396" end="32.679">许</span><span begin="32.679" end="33.167">那</span><span begin="33.167" end="34.010">天都</span><span begin="34.010" end="34.606">逝</span><span begin="34.606" end="36.645">去</span></p><p begin="37.126" end="45.219" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.126" end="37.872">海</span><span begin="37.872" end="38.278">面</span><span begin="38.278" end="39.069">闪着</span><span begin="39.069" end="41.144">泪</span> <span begin="41.635" end="42.549">像梦</span><span begin="42.549" end="45.219">境</span></p></div><div begin="45.399" end="1:16.230" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="45.399" end="52.224" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.399" end="45.882">你</span><span begin="45.882" end="46.722">的眼</span><span begin="46.722